#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to build a C extension for your Qiskit workflow in Python"
msgstr "Cara membina sambungan C untuk aliran kerja Qiskit anda dalam Python"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extend Qiskit in Python with C"
msgstr "Lanjutkan Qiskit dalam Python dengan C"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore strcmp */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore strcmp */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extend Qiskit in Python with C {#extend-qiskit-in-python-with-c}"
msgstr "Lanjutkan Qiskit dalam Python dengan C {#extend-qiskit-in-python-with-c}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit C API can be used within Python extension modules.\n"
"You can write performance-critical sections of your Qiskit extensions in C to accelerate them, and\n"
"then safely distribute these to your users.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit C API boleh digunakan dalam modul sambungan Python.\n"
"Anda boleh menulis bahagian kritikal prestasi sambungan Qiskit anda dalam C untuk mempercepatkannya, dan\n"
"kemudian mengedarkannya dengan selamat kepada pengguna anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide walks you through the process of defining a complete extension module, configuring\n"
"its build process, and exposing it to Python users.  The package provides a simple port of\n"
"[`AddSpectatorMeasures` from the Qiskit addons][AddSpectatorMeasures-code] to C.  This is a real custom\n"
"pass with a real use case in the Qiskit addons.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini membawa anda melalui proses mentakrifkan modul sambungan yang lengkap, mengkonfigurasi\n"
"proses pembinaannya, dan mendedahkannya kepada pengguna Python. Pakej ini menyediakan port mudah bagi\n"
"[`AddSpectatorMeasures` daripada tambahan Qiskit][AddSpectatorMeasures-code] kepada C. Ini ialah laluan\n"
"tersuai sebenar dengan kes penggunaan sebenar dalam tambahan Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Link reference
#, no-wrap
msgid "[AddSpectatorMeasures-code]: https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-utils/blob/e0582e4aa856dc7b152bacbe0c20d1fa306d9640/qiskit_addon_utils/noise_management/post_selection/transpiler/passes/add_spectator_measures.py#L32-L157"
msgstr "[AddSpectatorMeasures-code]: https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-utils/blob/e0582e4aa856dc7b152bacbe0c20d1fa306d9640/qiskit_addon_utils/noise_management/post_selection/transpiler/passes/add_spectator_measures.py#L32-L157"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"  You might find the following external resources helpful:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"  Anda mungkin mendapati sumber luaran berikut berguna:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[The CPython documentation on writing extension modules](https://docs.python.org/3/extending/index.html).\n"
msgstr "[Dokumentasi CPython tentang penulisan modul sambungan](https://docs.python.org/3/extending/index.html).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[The NumPy documentation on using its C API](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/user/c-info.how-to-extend.html).\n"
msgstr "[Dokumentasi NumPy tentang penggunaan C API-nya](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/user/c-info.how-to-extend.html).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  The Qiskit C API is exposed for Python extension modules in a very similar manner to the NumPy C\n"
"  API.  If you have previously programmed a NumPy extension, you will find the Qiskit process\n"
"  familiar.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Qiskit C API didedahkan untuk modul sambungan Python dengan cara yang sangat serupa dengan NumPy C\n"
"  API. Jika anda pernah mengaturcara sambungan NumPy sebelum ini, anda akan mendapati proses Qiskit\n"
"  ini sudah biasa.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"warning\">\n"
"  The Qiskit C API is still experimental. Thus, there is not yet a fully stable programming or\n"
"  binary interface, and there might be breaking changes between minor versions.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"warning\">\n"
"  Qiskit C API masih dalam peringkat eksperimental. Oleh itu, belum ada antara muka pengaturcaraan atau\n"
"  binari yang sepenuhnya stabil, dan mungkin ada perubahan yang memecahkan antara versi kecil.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  For example, an extension module using Qiskit v2.4.0 at build time is guaranteed to work with\n"
"  Qiskit v2.4.1 at runtime, but might break when using Qiskit v2.5.0 at runtime.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Sebagai contoh, modul sambungan yang menggunakan Qiskit v2.4.0 semasa pembinaan dijamin berfungsi dengan\n"
"  Qiskit v2.4.1 semasa masa jalan, tetapi mungkin gagal apabila menggunakan Qiskit v2.5.0 semasa masa jalan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements}"
msgstr "Keperluan {#requirements}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complete the instructions in the [Install](/guides/install-c-api) topic to install the following:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The standard C compiler toolchain for your platform\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A version of Python that includes its C API headers. \n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "You should be familiar with, or prepared to look up, the individual functions and objects available\n"
#| "in the [Qiskit C API][c-api].  You should have some familiarity with C programming.\n"
msgid ""
"You should also be familiar with, or prepared to look up, the functions and objects available\n"
"in the [Qiskit C API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-c), and should have some familiarity with C programming.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda seharusnya biasa dengan, atau bersedia untuk mencari, fungsi dan objek individu yang tersedia\n"
"dalam [Qiskit C API][c-api]. Anda seharusnya mempunyai sedikit kebiasaan dengan pengaturcaraan C.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start from a clean directory.\n"
msgstr "Mulakan dari direktori yang bersih.\n"

#. type: Link reference
#, no-wrap
msgid "[c-api]: /docs/api/qiskit-c"
msgstr "[c-api]: /docs/api/qiskit-c"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the directory structure {#create-the-directory-structure}"
msgstr "Cipta struktur direktori {#create-the-directory-structure}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will use a `src`-based directory structure and a simple `setuptools`-based build system.  These\n"
"instructions should be easy adapt to any build system that can build\n"
"extension modules.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami akan menggunakan struktur direktori berasaskan `src` dan sistem pembinaan berasaskan `setuptools` yang mudah. Arahan\n"
"ini seharusnya mudah disesuaikan dengan mana-mana sistem pembinaan yang boleh membina\n"
"modul sambungan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The final structure will look like:\n"
msgstr "Struktur akhir akan kelihatan seperti:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In summary:\n"
msgstr "Ringkasnya:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`pyproject.toml` defines the standard static metadata about the Python package we are creating,\n"
"including its name, author, and build- and run-time dependencies.\n"
msgstr ""
"`pyproject.toml` mentakrifkan metadata statik standard tentang pakej Python yang kami cipta,\n"
"termasuk nama, pengarang, dan kebergantungan masa pembinaan dan masa jalan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`setup.py` contains the minimal dynamic configuration we need to build our extension module.\n"
msgstr "`setup.py` mengandungi konfigurasi dinamik minimum yang kami perlukan untuk membina modul sambungan kami.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`src/spectator_measures/__init__.py` defines the user-facing interface and provides some code to\n"
"interface with Qiskit's Python-space components.\n"
msgstr ""
"`src/spectator_measures/__init__.py` mentakrifkan antara muka yang berhadapan dengan pengguna dan menyediakan beberapa kod untuk\n"
"berinteraksi dengan komponen ruang-Python Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`src/spectator_measures/_coremodule.c` defines the C extension module, which will contain all the\n"
"performance-critical code of our package.\n"
msgstr ""
"`src/spectator_measures/_coremodule.c` mentakrifkan modul sambungan C, yang akan mengandungi semua\n"
"kod kritikal prestasi pakej kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We will examine each file in detail, building up the package with its extension module.\n"
msgstr "Kami akan memeriksa setiap fail secara terperinci, membina pakej dengan modul sambungannya.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the package metadata {#define-the-package-metadata}"
msgstr "Takrifkan metadata pakej {#define-the-package-metadata}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Begin by defining the `pyproject.toml` file. This is standard for a `setuptools`-based\n"
"project, although  `qiskit` is an additional requirement in the `build-system.requires` array,\n"
"in addition to `setuptools`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mulakan dengan mentakrifkan fail `pyproject.toml`. Ini adalah standard untuk projek berasaskan\n"
"`setuptools`, walaupun `qiskit` adalah keperluan tambahan dalam tatasusunan `build-system.requires`,\n"
"sebagai tambahan kepada `setuptools`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`pyproject.toml`**\n"
msgstr "**`pyproject.toml`**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set Qiskit's runtime version in\n"
"`project.dependencies` to match the minor version used at build time.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In many pure-Python `setuptools`-based projects, it would be sufficient to have the\n"
"`pyproject.toml` file.  However, our module needs access to the Qiskit C API header files during\n"
"its build process.   Starting with v2.4, these are included in the Qiskit SDK Python distributions.\n"
"To locate the directory containing them, run `qiskit.capi.get_include()`.\n"
"This results in a `setup.py` file that looks like:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam banyak projek berasaskan `setuptools` Python tulen, fail `pyproject.toml` sudah mencukupi. Walau bagaimanapun, modul kami memerlukan akses kepada fail pengepala Qiskit C API semasa\n"
"proses pembinaannya. Bermula dengan v2.4, ini disertakan dalam pengedaran Python SDK Qiskit.\n"
"Untuk mencari direktori yang mengandunginya, jalankan `qiskit.capi.get_include()`.\n"
"Ini menghasilkan fail `setup.py` yang kelihatan seperti:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`setup.py`**\n"
msgstr "**`setup.py`**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Most of the package information is defined in `pyproject.toml`, and `setuptools.setup()` will\n"
"also read that file.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kebanyakan maklumat pakej ditakrifkan dalam `pyproject.toml`, dan `setuptools.setup()` akan\n"
"turut membaca fail tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"See the [`setuptools` User Guide](https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/userguide/) for more\n"
"information on configuring `setuptools`-based projects.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Lihat [Panduan Pengguna `setuptools`](https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/userguide/) untuk maklumat\n"
"lanjut tentang mengkonfigurasi projek berasaskan `setuptools`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Write the Python-space wrapper {#write-the-python-space-wrapper}"
msgstr "Tulis pembalut ruang-Python {#write-the-python-space-wrapper}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is technically possible to define everything in a Python extension from C.  In practice, it is\n"
"easier to interact with other Python-space code from Python itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara teknikalnya, adalah mungkin untuk mentakrifkan segalanya dalam sambungan Python daripada C. Dalam amalan, ia lebih\n"
"mudah untuk berinteraksi dengan kod ruang-Python lain daripada Python itu sendiri.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This package defines a custom transpiler pass that derives from the Python-space\n"
"`qiskit.transpiler.TransformationPass` class, but uses a function from the C extension module for\n"
"all of its business logic.  This looks like:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pakej ini mentakrifkan laluan Transpiler tersuai yang diterbitkan daripada kelas\n"
"`qiskit.transpiler.TransformationPass` ruang-Python, tetapi menggunakan fungsi daripada modul sambungan C untuk\n"
"semua logik perniagaannya. Ini kelihatan seperti:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`src/spectator_measures/__init__.py`**\n"
msgstr "**`src/spectator_measures/__init__.py`**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The exact details of this pass are unimportant for this guide.  If you are interested, you can\n"
"consult the [`AddSpectatorMeasures` API documentation in\n"
"`qiskit-addon-utils`][AddSpectatorMeasures-api].  This guide produces a simple port of that pass,\n"
"without support for control-flow operations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Butiran tepat laluan ini tidak penting untuk panduan ini. Jika anda berminat, anda boleh\n"
"merujuk [dokumentasi API `AddSpectatorMeasures` dalam\n"
"`qiskit-addon-utils`][AddSpectatorMeasures-api]. Panduan ini menghasilkan port mudah bagi laluan tersebut,\n"
"tanpa sokongan untuk operasi aliran kawalan.\n"

#. type: Link reference
#, no-wrap
msgid "[AddSpectatorMeasures-api]: https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/stubs/qiskit_addon_utils.noise_management.post_selection.transpiler.passes.AddSpectatorMeasures.html"
msgstr "[AddSpectatorMeasures-api]: https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/stubs/qiskit_addon_utils.noise_management.post_selection.transpiler.passes.AddSpectatorMeasures.html"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Write the C extension module {#write-the-c-extension-module}"
msgstr "Tulis modul sambungan C {#write-the-c-extension-module}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"  You may find the following resources helpful:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"  Anda mungkin mendapati sumber berikut berguna:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - [The Qiskit C API reference][c-api].\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  - [Rujukan Qiskit C API][c-api].\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This section is concerned with the actual C extension.  This is the most complex file in the\n"
"project, so we will split it into stages.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bahagian ini berkaitan dengan sambungan C sebenar. Ini adalah fail paling kompleks dalam\n"
"projek, jadi kami akan membahagikannya kepada peringkat-peringkat.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the header files {#configure-the-header-files}"
msgstr "Konfigurasi fail pengepala {#configure-the-header-files}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When building a Python extension module, you must include `Python.h` before any other file.\n"
"To use the Qiskit C API in an extension module, you must define the macro\n"
"`QISKIT_PYTHON_EXTENSION` before including `qiskit.h`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila membina modul sambungan Python, anda mesti menyertakan `Python.h` sebelum sebarang fail lain.\n"
"Untuk menggunakan Qiskit C API dalam modul sambungan, anda mesti mentakrifkan makro\n"
"`QISKIT_PYTHON_EXTENSION` sebelum menyertakan `qiskit.h`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Our includes then look like:\n"
msgstr "Include kami kemudiannya kelihatan seperti:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`src/spectator_measures/_coremodule.c`**\n"
msgstr "**`src/spectator_measures/_coremodule.c`**\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Write the pure C API code {#write-the-pure-c-api-code}"
msgstr "Tulis kod C API tulen {#write-the-pure-c-api-code}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, write all of the business logic as pure Qiskit C API code.  We will expose\n"
"this logic to Python space in the following section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seterusnya, tulis semua logik perniagaan sebagai kod Qiskit C API tulen. Kami akan mendedahkan\n"
"logik ini kepada ruang Python dalam bahagian berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section contains only pure Qiskit C API code.  It uses the C API types:\n"
msgstr "Bahagian ini mengandungi hanya kod Qiskit C API tulen. Ia menggunakan jenis C API:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QkDag *`, corresponding to the Python-space `DAGCircuit`.\n"
msgstr "`QkDag *`, sepadan dengan `DAGCircuit` ruang-Python.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QkTarget *`, corresponding to the Python-space `Target`.\n"
msgstr "`QkTarget *`, sepadan dengan `Target` ruang-Python.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QkNeighbors`, a native C API type representing two-qubit coupling constraints.\n"
msgstr "`QkNeighbors`, jenis C API natif yang mewakili kekangan gandingan dua qubit.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QkCircuitInstruction`, a native C API type for querying individual instructions.\n"
msgstr "`QkCircuitInstruction`, jenis C API natif untuk menanya arahan individu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The first two form part of our interaction with Python space, but when working with them, we\n"
"only need to consider the pure C API.  There is no interaction with the Python\n"
"interpreter in this code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dua yang pertama membentuk sebahagian daripada interaksi kami dengan ruang Python, tetapi apabila bekerja dengannya, kami\n"
"hanya perlu mempertimbangkan C API tulen. Tiada interaksi dengan jurubahasa Python\n"
"dalam kod ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that all functions and symbols defined in this section are declared with `static` linkage.\n"
"This is because the Python interpreter will not link against this extension module; we will provide\n"
"the interpreter with details of the available functions in the next section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahawa semua fungsi dan simbol yang ditakrifkan dalam bahagian ini dinyatakan dengan paut `static`.\n"
"Ini kerana jurubahasa Python tidak akan paut terhadap modul sambungan ini; kami akan menyediakan\n"
"jurubahasa dengan butiran fungsi yang tersedia dalam bahagian seterusnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will not dwell on the algorithmic details of this code; it is instructive to use a meaningful\n"
"transpiler pass for the demonstration, but the precise implementation of the algorithm is not\n"
"important to this guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami tidak akan memperincikan butiran algoritma kod ini; adalah instruktif untuk menggunakan laluan\n"
"Transpiler yang bermakna untuk demonstrasi, tetapi pelaksanaan tepat algoritma tersebut tidak\n"
"penting untuk panduan ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`src/spectator_measures/_coremodule.c (appended)`**\n"
msgstr "**`src/spectator_measures/_coremodule.c (appended)`**\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Write the Python interaction code {#write-the-python-interaction-code}"
msgstr "Tulis kod interaksi Python {#write-the-python-interaction-code}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "All of the business logic is now defined in pure C.  Next, it needs to be safely exposed to Python.\n"
msgstr "Semua logik perniagaan kini ditakrifkan dalam C tulen. Seterusnya, ia perlu didedahkan dengan selamat kepada Python.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To begin, define the only function that will be exposed to Python.  This must\n"
"follow a defined signature, which is purely in terms of Python types that look like a\n"
"`fn(self, *args, **kwargs)` method.  We have to return a `PyObject *`, which is the generic form of\n"
"any Python object.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk memulakan, takrifkan satu-satunya fungsi yang akan didedahkan kepada Python. Ini mesti\n"
"mengikut tandatangan yang ditakrifkan, yang sepenuhnya dalam sebutan jenis Python yang kelihatan seperti kaedah\n"
"`fn(self, *args, **kwargs)`. Kami perlu mengembalikan `PyObject *`, yang merupakan bentuk generik bagi\n"
"sebarang objek Python.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The complete function looks like:\n"
msgstr "Fungsi lengkap kelihatan seperti:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In brief, the function:\n"
msgstr "Ringkasnya, fungsi ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follows a defined signature to accept arbitrary Python arguments.\n"
msgstr "Mengikuti tandatangan yang ditakrifkan untuk menerima argumen Python sewenang-wenangnya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Defines space to store C-native objects parsed out of the Python arguments.\n"
msgstr "Mentakrifkan ruang untuk menyimpan objek natif-C yang dihuraikan daripada argumen Python.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Calls a parsing function to extract the C-native objects, configured with the list of expected\n"
"arguments, keyword arguments, and the functions to use to convert them.  If this fails, the\n"
"function propagates the error.\n"
msgstr ""
"Memanggil fungsi penghuraian untuk mengekstrak objek natif-C, dikonfigurasi dengan senarai argumen yang dijangka,\n"
"argumen kata kunci, dan fungsi yang digunakan untuk menukarnya. Jika ini gagal, fungsi\n"
"menyebarkan ralat.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delegates to the C-native business logic of the previous section, which mutates the DAG in place.\n"
msgstr "Mengagihkan kepada logik perniagaan natif-C bahagian sebelumnya, yang mengubah DAG di tempatnya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Returns the Python-space `None` object.\n"
msgstr "Mengembalikan objek `None` ruang-Python.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The most complex logic is all inside `PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords`.  This is well documented in [the\n"
"CPython documentation on parsing arguments](https://docs.python.org/3/c-api/arg.html), which you\n"
"should consult for further information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Logik paling kompleks semuanya berada dalam `PyArg_ParseTupleAndKeywords`. Ini didokumentasikan dengan baik dalam [dokumentasi\n"
"CPython tentang menghurai argumen](https://docs.python.org/3/c-api/arg.html), yang patut anda\n"
"rujuk untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit C API provides several functions with names like `qk_*_convert_from_python`, which are\n"
"designed as \"converter\" functions for use with `PyArg_Parse*`functions.  These correspond to the\n"
"`O&` keys in the format string; here, we used `qk_dag_convert_from_python` and\n"
"`qk_target_convert_from_python`.  These functions _borrow_ the C-native object from the Python\n"
"argument they are derived from.  This means that mutations will propagate to Python space, but also that\n"
"you should take care not to release your reference to the Python object that backs them, while using\n"
"the result.  This is standard for Python C API programming.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit C API menyediakan beberapa fungsi dengan nama seperti `qk_*_convert_from_python`, yang direka\n"
"sebagai fungsi \"penukar\" untuk digunakan dengan fungsi `PyArg_Parse*`. Ini sepadan dengan\n"
"kunci `O&` dalam rentetan format; di sini, kami menggunakan `qk_dag_convert_from_python` dan\n"
"`qk_target_convert_from_python`. Fungsi-fungsi ini _meminjam_ objek natif-C daripada argumen Python\n"
"yang ia diterbitkan. Ini bermakna mutasi akan disebarkan ke ruang Python, tetapi juga bahawa\n"
"anda harus berhati-hati untuk tidak melepaskan rujukan anda kepada objek Python yang menyokongnya, semasa menggunakan\n"
"hasilnya. Ini adalah standard untuk pengaturcaraan Python C API.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, we define the information about this module and the function it contains, so we can pass it to\n"
"Python space:\n"
msgstr ""
"Seterusnya, kami mentakrifkan maklumat tentang modul ini dan fungsi yang dikandunginya, supaya kami boleh menghantar ia ke\n"
"ruang Python:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This method table and module-definition structure are described in more detail in [the CPython\n"
"documentation on module\n"
"initialization](https://docs.python.org/3/extending/extending.html#the-module-s-method-table-and-initialization-function).\n"
msgstr ""
"Jadual kaedah dan struktur takrifan-modul ini diterangkan dengan lebih terperinci dalam [dokumentasi CPython tentang\n"
"permulaan\n"
"modul](https://docs.python.org/3/extending/extending.html#the-module-s-method-table-and-initialization-function).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, tell Python how to initialize the module.  This is the only function in the C\n"
"file that is exported.  Its name _must_ exactly match the pattern\n"
"`PyInit_<mod>`, where `<mod>` is the (unqualified) module name.  In this case, the fully\n"
"qualified module name is `spectator_measures._core`, and the unqualified name is `_core`, so our\n"
"function must be called `PyInit__core`, with the double underscore.\n"
msgstr ""
"Akhirnya, beritahu Python cara memulakan modul. Ini adalah satu-satunya fungsi dalam fail C\n"
"yang dieksport. Namanya _mesti_ sepadan tepat dengan corak\n"
"`PyInit_<mod>`, di mana `<mod>` adalah nama modul (tidak layak). Dalam kes ini, nama modul yang layak\n"
"sepenuhnya ialah `spectator_measures._core`, dan nama yang tidak layak ialah `_core`, jadi fungsi kami\n"
"mesti dipanggil `PyInit__core`, dengan garis bawah berganda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `PyMODINIT_FUNC` and `PyModuleDef_Init` symbols are both standard Python C API programming.  The\n"
"Qiskit-specific component is `qk_import()`.  It is critical that you call this function during the\n"
"initialization function of your module; you will not be able to call any Qiskit C API functions\n"
"until this has been successfully executed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Simbol `PyMODINIT_FUNC` dan `PyModuleDef_Init` kedua-duanya adalah pengaturcaraan Python C API standard. Komponen\n"
"khusus Qiskit ialah `qk_import()`. Adalah kritikal bahawa anda memanggil fungsi ini semasa fungsi\n"
"permulaan modul anda; anda tidak akan dapat memanggil sebarang fungsi Qiskit C API\n"
"sehingga ini berjaya dilaksanakan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the package from Python {#use-the-package-from-python}"
msgstr "Gunakan pakej daripada Python {#use-the-package-from-python}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is now a complete package, including a C extension module.  Because only standard\n"
"tooling was used, and no non-standard system libraries are linked during build time,\n"
"the build process is simple.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini kini merupakan pakej yang lengkap, termasuk modul sambungan C. Oleh sebab hanya alatan standard\n"
"digunakan, dan tiada perpustakaan sistem bukan-standard yang dipaut semasa masa pembinaan,\n"
"proses pembinaan adalah mudah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use any PEP-517-compatible build tool.  As a minimal example, you can run the following command in the repository root to install the package.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menggunakan mana-mana alatan pembinaan serasi PEP-517. Sebagai contoh minimum, anda boleh menjalankan arahan berikut dalam akar repositori untuk memasang pakej.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This compiles the C extension module and\n"
"installs the complete Python package in your environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini mengkompil modul sambungan C dan\n"
"memasang pakej Python yang lengkap dalam persekitaran anda.\n"

